@flexiarg operator/pick-an-offered-option
@title pick an offered option
@status accepted 2026-11-11: proposed by 象 for 2 turns (Joe 2026-11-11: recurrence suffices); attested once used in a mission or a War Machine cascade
@provenance 象 proposals, ~/.emacs-graph/session-turn-analysis/<record>[.json].candidates.json; records: turn-2bpCVY turn-9OKHKi
@parent orchestration/pattern-warranted-choice-point
@context The agent has offered options for decision D3 and recommended one.

! conclusion: Bind the selection to the menu, treat unchosen options as declined and proceed on R2.

  + IF:
    The operator says 'With D3, let's go with R2 (your recommendation)'.

  + HOWEVER:
    He follows the agent's recommendation, so the choice is the agent's as much as his.

  + THEN:
    Bind the selection to the menu, treat unchosen options as declined and proceed on R2.

  + BECAUSE:
    The operator has chosen from the agent's menu.
